# Clear the map before either arm reads anything else. The hounds do not stop
# for the character screen, and a death prompt raised while a scroll is being
# read spends every key after it. Wizard option 11 counted from the top of
# src/Debug.cpp:544 kills every monster on the level and costs no game time.
w
@choose "Genocide Everything"
@while "Die?" n
@while "more --" SPACE
@until "Things in View" ESC
